{"seq":1,"slug":"tool-systems","title":"Tool 工具系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/tools-and-capabilities/tool-systems","wordCount":1651,"readingTime":7,"html":"<h1 id=\"tool-工具系统\">Tool 工具系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>大语言模型（LLM）的核心能力是文本生成，但仅靠生成文本无法完成实际的编程任务——它需要读取文件、执行命令、搜索代码库、访问网络。<strong>工具（Tool）</strong> 是 AI Agent 与外部世界交互的桥梁，每一种能力都被封装为一个可调用的函数，由模型在推理过程中自主决定何时、如何调用。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    User[User Input] --&gt; LLM[LLM]&#10;    LLM --&gt; Decision{Need external operation?}&#10;    Decision -- No --&gt; Response[Direct reply]&#10;    Decision -- Yes --&gt; ToolCall[Generate tool call]&#10;    ToolCall --&gt; Execution[Tool Execution Engine]&#10;    Execution --&gt; Result[Execution Result]&#10;    Result --&gt; LLM&#10;    LLM --&gt; Response\">flowchart LR\n    User[User Input] --&gt; LLM[LLM]\n    LLM --&gt; Decision{Need external operation?}\n    Decision -- No --&gt; Response[Direct reply]\n    Decision -- Yes --&gt; ToolCall[Generate tool call]\n    ToolCall --&gt; Execution[Tool Execution Engine]\n    Execution --&gt; Result[Execution Result]\n    Result --&gt; LLM\n    LLM --&gt; Response</pre><p>工具系统的核心思想是：<strong>模型负责决策，工具负责执行</strong>。模型根据用户意图判断需要调用哪个工具、传入什么参数，工具执行引擎负责真正的操作，并将结果返回给模型继续推理。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"工作原理\">工作原理</h2><h3 id=\"function-calling\">Function Calling</h3><p>Function Calling 是 OpenAI 率先提出的工具调用机制，已成为业界标准。其核心流程分为三步：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>工具注册</strong>：开发者以 JSON Schema 的形式声明可用工具的名称、描述和参数结构</li>\n<li><strong>模型决策</strong>：模型在推理时，根据上下文决定是否调用工具，并生成结构化的调用请求</li>\n<li><strong>结果注入</strong>：工具执行后，结果以消息的形式插入对话上下文，模型基于结果继续生成</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;type&quot;: &quot;function&quot;,&#10;  &quot;function&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;name&quot;: &quot;read_file&quot;,&#10;    &quot;description&quot;: &quot;读取指定路径的文件内容&quot;,&#10;    &quot;parameters&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;object&quot;,&#10;      &quot;properties&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;file_path&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;string&quot;,&#10;          &quot;description&quot;: &quot;要读取的文件的绝对路径&quot;&#10;        },&#10;        &quot;offset&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;integer&quot;,&#10;          &quot;description&quot;: &quot;起始行号，从 1 开始&quot;&#10;        },&#10;        &quot;limit&quot;: {&#10;          &quot;type&quot;: &quot;integer&quot;,&#10;          &quot;description&quot;: &quot;读取的最大行数&quot;&#10;        }&#10;      },&#10;      &quot;required&quot;: [&quot;file_path&quot;]&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"read_file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"读取指定路径的文件内容\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"parameters\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"object\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"properties\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"file_path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"string\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"要读取的文件的绝对路径\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"offset\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"integer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"起始行号，从 1 开始\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"limit\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"integer\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">          \"description\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"读取的最大行数\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"required\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"file_path\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>模型生成的调用请求格式如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tool_calls&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;call_abc123&quot;,&#10;      &quot;type&quot;: &quot;function&quot;,&#10;      &quot;function&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;name&quot;: &quot;read_file&quot;,&#10;        &quot;arguments&quot;: &quot;{\\&quot;file_path\\&quot;: \\&quot;/src/index.ts\\&quot;, \\&quot;limit\\&quot;: 50}&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tool_calls\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"call_abc123\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"type\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"read_file\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"arguments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">file_path</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/src/index.ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">limit</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: 50}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"mcp-model-context-protocol\">MCP（Model Context Protocol）</h3><p>MCP 是 Anthropic 提出的开放协议，旨在标准化模型与外部工具、数据源之间的通信方式。如果说 Function Calling 解决的是&quot;如何调用一个工具&quot;，MCP 解决的则是&quot;如何发现、连接和管理一组工具服务&quot;。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TB&#10;    subgraph Host[&quot;AI Application (Host)&quot;]&#10;        LLM[&quot;LLM&quot;]&#10;        Client1[&quot;MCP Client A&quot;]&#10;        Client2[&quot;MCP Client B&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph ServerA[&quot;MCP Server A&quot;]&#10;        ToolA1[&quot;File System Tools&quot;]&#10;        ToolA2[&quot;Git Tools&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph ServerB[&quot;MCP Server B&quot;]&#10;        ToolB1[&quot;Database Query&quot;]&#10;        ToolB2[&quot;API calls&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    LLM --&gt; Client1&#10;    LLM --&gt; Client2&#10;    Client1 --&gt; ServerA&#10;    Client2 --&gt; ServerB\">flowchart TB\n    subgraph Host[\"AI Application (Host)\"]\n        LLM[\"LLM\"]\n        Client1[\"MCP Client A\"]\n        Client2[\"MCP Client B\"]\n    end\n    subgraph ServerA[\"MCP Server A\"]\n        ToolA1[\"File System Tools\"]\n        ToolA2[\"Git Tools\"]\n    end\n    subgraph ServerB[\"MCP Server B\"]\n        ToolB1[\"Database Query\"]\n        ToolB2[\"API calls\"]\n    end\n    LLM --&gt; Client1\n    LLM --&gt; Client2\n    Client1 --&gt; ServerA\n    Client2 --&gt; ServerB</pre><p>MCP 的关键设计包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Client-Server 架构</strong>：AI 应用作为 Host 持有多个 MCP Client，每个 Client 连接一个 MCP Server</li>\n<li><strong>协议标准化</strong>：工具的声明、调用、结果返回都遵循统一的 JSON-RPC 协议</li>\n<li><strong>动态发现</strong>：Client 启动时自动获取 Server 提供的工具列表，无需硬编码</li>\n<li><strong>传输层灵活</strong>：支持 stdio、HTTP+SSE 等多种传输方式</li>\n</ul>\n<p>MCP Server 的配置示例：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;mcpServers&quot;: {&#10;    &quot;filesystem&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,&#10;      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;-y&quot;, &quot;@anthropic/mcp-filesystem&quot;],&#10;      &quot;env&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;ALLOWED_DIRS&quot;: &quot;/Users/dev/projects&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    },&#10;    &quot;github&quot;: {&#10;      &quot;command&quot;: &quot;npx&quot;,&#10;      &quot;args&quot;: [&quot;-y&quot;, &quot;@anthropic/mcp-github&quot;],&#10;      &quot;env&quot;: {&#10;        &quot;GITHUB_TOKEN&quot;: &quot;${GITHUB_TOKEN}&quot;&#10;      }&#10;    }&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"mcpServers\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"filesystem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"args\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@anthropic/mcp-filesystem\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"ALLOWED_DIRS\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"/Users/dev/projects\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    \"github\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"command\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"npx\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"args\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"-y\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"@anthropic/mcp-github\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"env\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        \"GITHUB_TOKEN\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"${GITHUB_TOKEN}\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">      }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"关键要素\">关键要素</h2><h3 id=\"工具的分类\">工具的分类</h3><p>AI 编程助手中的工具可分为两大类：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>类别</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n<th>典型示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><strong>内置工具</strong></td>\n<td>由 AI IDE 或 Agent 框架直接提供，无需额外配置</td>\n<td>文件读写、终端命令、代码搜索、Web 搜索</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><strong>外部工具</strong></td>\n<td>通过 MCP 或插件机制动态加载的第三方能力</td>\n<td>数据库查询、CI/CD 触发、Figma 设计稿解析</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"工具-schema\">工具 Schema</h3><p>每个工具都通过 JSON Schema 描述其接口契约。一个完整的工具定义包含：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"interface ToolDefinition {&#10;  name: string; // 工具名称，唯一标识&#10;  description: string; // 自然语言描述，帮助模型理解何时使用&#10;  parameters: JSONSchema; // 参数的 JSON Schema 定义&#10;  required?: string[]; // 必填参数列表&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">interface</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> ToolDefinition</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 工具名称，唯一标识</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  description</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 自然语言描述，帮助模型理解何时使用</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  parameters</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> JSONSchema</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 参数的 JSON Schema 定义</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">  required</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">?:</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[]; </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 必填参数列表</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 工具的 <code>description</code> 字段极为关键——模型完全依赖自然语言描述来决定是否调用某个工具。描述不清晰会导致工具被误用或遗漏。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<h3 id=\"常见内置工具\">常见内置工具</h3><p>以下是主流 AI 编程助手中的常见内置工具：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>工具</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>使用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>ReadFile</code></td>\n<td>读取文件内容</td>\n<td>查看源码、配置文件、日志</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WriteFile</code></td>\n<td>写入或创建文件</td>\n<td>生成代码、修改配置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SearchReplace</code></td>\n<td>搜索并替换文件内容</td>\n<td>精确编辑现有代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>RunCommand</code></td>\n<td>执行终端命令</td>\n<td>构建、测试、安装依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>SearchCodebase</code></td>\n<td>语义化代码搜索</td>\n<td>理解项目结构、查找相关代码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Grep</code></td>\n<td>正则搜索文件内容</td>\n<td>精确定位字符串、模式匹配</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Glob</code></td>\n<td>按文件名模式匹配</td>\n<td>查找特定类型或命名的文件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WebSearch</code></td>\n<td>互联网搜索</td>\n<td>查询最新文档、解决方案</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>WebFetch</code></td>\n<td>抓取网页内容</td>\n<td>读取在线文档、API 参考</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"工具执行安全\">工具执行安全</h3><p>工具赋予了 AI 在真实环境中执行操作的能力，因此安全控制至关重要：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Call[Model initiates tool call] --&gt; Check{Safety Check}&#10;    Check --&gt; Safe[Safe Operation]&#10;    Check --&gt; Risky[Sensitive Operation]&#10;    Safe --&gt; Auto[Auto-execute]&#10;    Risky --&gt; Approval[User Approval]&#10;    Approval -- Approve --&gt; Execute[Execute]&#10;    Approval -- Reject --&gt; Cancel[Cancel]&#10;    Auto --&gt; Result[Return Result]&#10;    Execute --&gt; Result\">flowchart TD\n    Call[Model initiates tool call] --&gt; Check{Safety Check}\n    Check --&gt; Safe[Safe Operation]\n    Check --&gt; Risky[Sensitive Operation]\n    Safe --&gt; Auto[Auto-execute]\n    Risky --&gt; Approval[User Approval]\n    Approval -- Approve --&gt; Execute[Execute]\n    Approval -- Reject --&gt; Cancel[Cancel]\n    Auto --&gt; Result[Return Result]\n    Execute --&gt; Result</pre><p>安全控制的核心策略：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>分级权限</strong>：读操作（如文件读取、代码搜索）自动执行；写操作（如文件修改、命令执行）可能需要用户确认</li>\n<li><strong>沙箱隔离</strong>：终端命令在受限环境中运行，限制可访问的目录和可执行的命令</li>\n<li><strong>路径约束</strong>：文件操作限制在项目目录范围内，防止越权访问系统文件</li>\n<li><strong>秘密保护</strong>：禁止在代码中硬编码密钥、令牌等敏感信息；环境变量通过引用传入</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"实际应用\">实际应用</h2><h3 id=\"一次典型的工具调用链\">一次典型的工具调用链</h3><p>当用户要求&quot;帮我修复这个 TypeScript 编译错误&quot;时，Agent 的工具调用链可能如下：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"用户: 帮我修复 src/utils.ts 的编译错误&#10;&#10;[1] Agent 调用 RunCommand: npx tsc --noEmit&#10;    → 获取编译错误信息&#10;&#10;[2] Agent 调用 ReadFile: /src/utils.ts&#10;    → 读取出错的源文件&#10;&#10;[3] Agent 调用 SearchCodebase: &quot;相关类型定义&quot;&#10;    → 查找关联的类型声明&#10;&#10;[4] Agent 调用 SearchReplace: 修复类型错误&#10;    → 编辑文件内容&#10;&#10;[5] Agent 调用 RunCommand: npx tsc --noEmit&#10;    → 验证修复结果&#10;&#10;Agent: 已修复，问题是参数类型不匹配...\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>用户: 帮我修复 src/utils.ts 的编译错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[1] Agent 调用 RunCommand: npx tsc --noEmit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 获取编译错误信息</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[2] Agent 调用 ReadFile: /src/utils.ts</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 读取出错的源文件</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[3] Agent 调用 SearchCodebase: \"相关类型定义\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 查找关联的类型声明</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[4] Agent 调用 SearchReplace: 修复类型错误</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 编辑文件内容</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[5] Agent 调用 RunCommand: npx tsc --noEmit</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    → 验证修复结果</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>Agent: 已修复，问题是参数类型不匹配...</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"并行工具调用\">并行工具调用</h3><p>现代 AI Agent 支持在一次推理中同时发起多个独立的工具调用，大幅提升效率：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"json\" data-code=\"{&#10;  &quot;tool_calls&quot;: [&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;call_1&quot;,&#10;      &quot;function&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;ReadFile&quot;, &quot;arguments&quot;: &quot;{\\&quot;file_path\\&quot;: \\&quot;/src/api.ts\\&quot;}&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;call_2&quot;,&#10;      &quot;function&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;ReadFile&quot;, &quot;arguments&quot;: &quot;{\\&quot;file_path\\&quot;: \\&quot;/src/types.ts\\&quot;}&quot; }&#10;    },&#10;    {&#10;      &quot;id&quot;: &quot;call_3&quot;,&#10;      &quot;function&quot;: { &quot;name&quot;: &quot;Grep&quot;, &quot;arguments&quot;: &quot;{\\&quot;pattern\\&quot;: \\&quot;fetchUser\\&quot;, \\&quot;path\\&quot;: \\&quot;/src\\&quot;}&quot; }&#10;    }&#10;  ]&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  \"tool_calls\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"call_1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ReadFile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"arguments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">file_path</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/src/api.ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"call_2\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"ReadFile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"arguments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">file_path</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/src/types.ts</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"id\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"call_3\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">      \"function\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: { </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"Grep\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\"arguments\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"{</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">pattern</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">fetchUser</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">path</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/src</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\\"</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">}\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  ]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 并行调用的前提是各工具之间没有依赖关系。如果后一个工具需要前一个工具的结果作为输入，则必须串行执行。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"常见误区\">常见误区</h2><h3 id=\"误区一-工具越多越好\">误区一：工具越多越好</h3><p>过多的工具会增加模型的选择困难，导致调用不准确或延迟增加。好的工具设计应该覆盖核心需求，保持工具集精简。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误区二-工具描述无所谓\">误区二：工具描述无所谓</h3><p>模型完全依赖 <code>description</code> 来理解工具的用途和适用场景。模糊的描述会导致模型在不该调用时调用、在该调用时遗漏。编写描述时应明确说明工具的功能、适用场景和使用限制。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误区三-所有操作都需要用户确认\">误区三：所有操作都需要用户确认</h3><p>过度的审批机制会严重降低效率。合理的做法是对只读操作自动放行，仅对具有副作用的写操作（特别是不可逆操作）要求确认。</p>\n<h3 id=\"误区四-忽视工具调用的-token-开销\">误区四：忽视工具调用的 Token 开销</h3><p>每个工具的 Schema 定义都会占用上下文窗口。注册 50 个工具，每个工具描述 200 Token，仅工具声明就占用 10,000 Token。应根据当前任务动态加载相关工具，而非一次性注册所有工具。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>工具是 AI Agent 与外部世界交互的基本单元</strong>，将文件操作、命令执行、搜索等能力封装为可调用的函数。</li>\n<li><strong>Function Calling</strong> 是工具调用的标准机制：模型生成结构化调用请求，执行引擎返回结果。</li>\n<li><strong>MCP 协议</strong> 标准化了工具服务的发现、连接和管理，支持动态扩展 Agent 能力。</li>\n<li>工具分为<strong>内置工具</strong>和<strong>外部工具</strong>，通过 <strong>JSON Schema</strong> 描述接口契约。</li>\n<li><strong>执行安全</strong>是工具系统的核心考量，采用分级权限、沙箱隔离、路径约束等策略。</li>\n<li>并行调用可提升效率，但需确保工具之间无依赖关系。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Tool 工具系统","id":"tool-工具系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"工作原理","id":"工作原理"},{"level":3,"text":"Function Calling","id":"function-calling"},{"level":3,"text":"MCP（Model Context Protocol）","id":"mcp-model-context-protocol"},{"level":2,"text":"关键要素","id":"关键要素"},{"level":3,"text":"工具的分类","id":"工具的分类"},{"level":3,"text":"工具 Schema","id":"工具-schema"},{"level":3,"text":"常见内置工具","id":"常见内置工具"},{"level":3,"text":"工具执行安全","id":"工具执行安全"},{"level":2,"text":"实际应用","id":"实际应用"},{"level":3,"text":"一次典型的工具调用链","id":"一次典型的工具调用链"},{"level":3,"text":"并行工具调用","id":"并行工具调用"},{"level":2,"text":"常见误区","id":"常见误区"},{"level":3,"text":"误区一：工具越多越好","id":"误区一-工具越多越好"},{"level":3,"text":"误区二：工具描述无所谓","id":"误区二-工具描述无所谓"},{"level":3,"text":"误区三：所有操作都需要用户确认","id":"误区三-所有操作都需要用户确认"},{"level":3,"text":"误区四：忽视工具调用的 Token 开销","id":"误区四-忽视工具调用的-token-开销"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"代码库理解","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/context-and-memory/codebase-understanding"},"next":{"title":"Skill 技能系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-coding/tools-and-capabilities/skill-systems"}}